evidence = "The snapshot identified at docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:4 still reports 53 files and 46 disabled at docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:13 and docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:15 despite its 52 workflow rows containing 7 enabled, 45 disabled, 21 failures, 13 successes, 16 without runs and 2 skipped at docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:48 through docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:99, with the skipped rows at docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:72 and docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:83 absent from the summary buckets totaling 50 at docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:16 through docs/release/7.0.0-readiness-matrix.md:20; the original commit 34a0a294e05a8a49cf3f45b5eecad4e6796e030f contains 52 workflow files, whereas this revision contains 54 following the additions of .github/workflows/launchpad-test.yml:1 and .github/workflows/wallet-test.yml:1, so the historical summary correction remains necessary."
close_comment = "The recorded readiness snapshot still has inconsistent workflow totals and omits its two skipped workflows from the summary. A focused documentation correction is tracked to report 52 workflows, 7 enabled and 45 disabled, with the two skipped workflows included in the status totals."

